Changes made for the IEC P1 reader:
- __init__.py: new optional `page` setting. At build time the page
  (default: esphome/ui/portal.html) is compressed (gzip, or brotli when
  `compression: br` and the brotli module is available) and emitted into
  main.cpp as INDEX_GZ / INDEX_GZ_SIZE. If portal.html is missing, the stock
  ESPHome page (stock_portal.html, extracted from ESPHome) is used.
- captive_index.h: holds only the declarations of INDEX_GZ / INDEX_GZ_SIZE.
- captive_portal.cpp: uses INDEX_GZ_SIZE instead of sizeof(INDEX_GZ).
- The /config.json and /wifisave endpoints are unchanged.
